  my @changes = $plan->changes;

Returns all of the changes in the plan. This constitutes the entire plan.

=head3 C<tags>

  my @tags = $plan->tags;

Returns all of the tags in the plan.

=head3 C<count>

  my $count = $plan->count;

Returns the number of changes in the plan.

