=head1 Name

App::Sqitch::X - Sqitch Exception class

=head1 Synopsis

  use Locale::TextDomain;
  use App::Sqitch::X qw(hurl);
  open my $fh, '>', 'foo.txt' or hurl {
      ident   => 'io',
      message => __x 'Cannot open {file}: {err}", file => 'foo.txt', err => $!,
